## No N+1 Queries

Never execute a database query inside a loop iterating over results from another query.

### Rules
- Use eager loading / includes / joins instead of lazy loading in loops
- Use batch fetching: `WHERE id IN (...)` instead of individual `WHERE id = ?` per item
- Use DataLoader pattern for GraphQL resolvers
- Watch for ORM lazy-loading traps (accessing relations in loops)

### Bad
```
const users = await db.query('SELECT * FROM users');
for (const user of users) {
  user.posts = await db.query('SELECT * FROM posts WHERE user_id = ?', user.id);
}
```

### Good
```
const users = await db.query('SELECT * FROM users');
const userIds = users.map(u => u.id);
const posts = await db.query('SELECT * FROM posts WHERE user_id IN (?)', [userIds]);
```
